@{ ViewData["Title"] = "Account recovery"; }
<h1 data-i18n="Account recovery">Account recovery</h1>
<p data-i18n="If you know your password and saved a recovery code, sign in with your password, then choose “Use a recovery code” on the authenticator screen.">If you know your password and saved a recovery code, sign in with your password, then choose “Use a recovery code” on the authenticator screen.</p>
<p data-i18n="If you forgot your password, or lost both your authenticator and recovery codes, contact your platform operator through your established trusted channel. The operator must verify your identity and run the audited local recovery procedure. Ordinary company administrators cannot reset existing accounts through the web application.">If you forgot your password, or lost both your authenticator and recovery codes, contact your platform operator through your established trusted channel. The operator must verify your identity and run the audited local recovery procedure. Ordinary company administrators cannot reset existing accounts through the web application.</p>
<p data-i18n="This application does not send email/SMS reset links. Never put passwords, authenticator keys, recovery codes or reset tokens in support tickets.">This application does not send email/SMS reset links. Never put passwords, authenticator keys, recovery codes or reset tokens in support tickets.</p>
<p><a href="/Account/Login" data-i18n="Return to sign in">Return to sign in</a></p>
